    "pkF-ZU-UHK.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"When you first quit smoking, it's totally normal to feel a bit jumpy or restless. It's like your body is adjusting without nicotine, and it can affect not just your mind but the rest of you too.\\n\\nHere's how you can handle it:\"; ObjectID = \"pkF-ZU-UHK\";",
